# Gold light

When the user says **gold light** (or “apply gold light” / spotlight) to a named card:

1. Use `GoldLight` from `@/components/branding/GoldLight`.
2. Parent card: `relative overflow-hidden group` (so hover works).
3. Put content in `relative z-10` above the light.
4. **Color:** default is gold `#F6A724`. When the user names a color, pass `color="#......"`.
5. **Placement:** `top-center` (default), `left-center`, `right-center`, or `bottom-center`.
6. Pass `active` to force on; omit/`false` for group-hover only.

## Locked placements

| Placement | Origin |
|-----------|--------|
| `top-center` | Middle of top edge |
| `left-center` | Left edge → wash right |
| `right-center` | Right edge → wash left |
| `bottom-center` | Middle of bottom edge |

